# AI Development Guide

## Project Name

GitHub User Finder

---

# Purpose of AI Assistance

Artificial Intelligence was used only as a learning assistant throughout the development of this project.

AI was not used to generate the complete project automatically. Instead, it helped in understanding concepts, debugging issues, improving the UI, and learning best development practices.

---

